  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  dialogueList:
  - My son...
  - My... Ah, I recognize you...
  - You have come to claim our soul, haven't you?
  - I need you to find my son. I cannot bear for him to suffer here any longer.
  - I thought I heard his voice carry over from the southern sector, but anytime
    I attempt to approach, I am thwarted by the deluded spirits on the bridge.
  - We will be put to rest, I promise... but he could never rest without me. For
    both of us, I beg you let me find him.
  - Please. It would mean ever so much to me.
